msgctxt "140"
msgid "You sure can run."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "It's okay, I'm not gonna hurt you. Come here, boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Grrrrr!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Oh, sir! You cornered him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Yup. Only took running half a marathon to do it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Wow, sir! That's incredible!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "He's still scared, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Grrrr... Bark, bark!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Uncle Kaz, Uncle Kaz! Can we keep him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Whaddya mean, keep him? The thing's terrified of you guys.\r\n"
"Can't see why you'd want him, anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Well I do want him! Because... Because..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "What is it, Izumi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Because he looks like Mame!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "...Mame?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "That's the dog my mommy and daddy got for me when I was born."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Izumi-chan... They might look the same, but this dog here's\r\n"
"not your Mame."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"I know he's not. I had to give Mame away when mommy and\r\n"
"daddy died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Izumi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"But when this doggy showed up near our house, I thought for\r\n"
"a sec that Mame came to see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Izumi-chan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "So can we keep him, Uncle Kaz? Please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "...Okay, but only if you train him to not be so crazy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Deal!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Come on, Izumi-chan. That dog's never gonna be normal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Grrrrrrrrrrrrrr... Bark, bark bark!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"It's okay, Izumi. Everyone's afraid of new things, dogs and\r\n"
"people alike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"But if you show him you're scared, he'll be scared, too.\r\n"
"So you just have to put on a brave face. Understand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Mhm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Well? How're you gonna tame him, Izumi-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "I'm just gonna keep trying 'til he's used to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Trying... what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Uncle Kaz, what do dogs like to eat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Oh, that's an easy one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Dog food, obviously."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Well duh, Uncle Kaz! But, um... can you go buy some?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "...Why do I have to go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "So I can stay here with the puppy. I think he likes me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Please, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Hamburgers, believe it or not. I think it's the bun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Really...? Then can you go get us one, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "...Why do I have to go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "So I can stay here with the puppy. I think he likes me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Please, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "He's still just a puppy, so maybe some milk?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's a good idea! I'm sure he's thirsty, too. Can you\r\n"
"go get some, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "...Why do I have to go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "So I can stay here with the puppy. I think he likes me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Please, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Definitely bones!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Bones? Seriously, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Of course. All the dogs in cartoons love them, so a real\r\n"
"dog would probably think the same way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Okay! Can you go get one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "...Why do I have to go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "So I can stay here with the puppy. I think he likes me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Please, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "I don't even know if they sell bones around here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "But it was your idea! Come onnn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid ""
"...All right, I'll be back in a minute. Keep an eye on Izumi\r\n"
"for me, Mikio."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr "Sì, signore!"

msgctxt "992"
msgid ""
"(I should've just kept my big mouth shut. Where am I\r\n"
"supposed to find a bone around here anyway? Guess I\r\n"
"could always check the stores...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"All right, I'll be back in a minute. Keep an eye on Izumi\r\n"
"for me, Mikio."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr "Sì, signore!"

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "Dog food, obviously."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Hamburgers, believe it or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "Maybe milk?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "Definitely bones!"
msgstr ""

